@[expose] public section

/-!
# Exact kind quotas for the one-six-type graph universe

The four positive tags represent tetrahedra, bipyramids, square pyramids,
and the complete six-vertex template of index zero. The actual template
assignment remains attached to the count vector throughout this reduction.
